{"id":"rabbit-remote-control","name":"Rabbit remote control","tagline":"Remote control software","blurb":"Rabbit remote control is a open-source, cross-platform, multi-protocol remote control software.","description":"Rabbit remote control is a open-source, cross-platform, multi-protocol remote control software.\n\nAllows you to use any device and system in anywhere and remotely manage any device and system in any way.\n\nIt's goal is to be simple, convenient, security and easy to use, improving work efficiency.\n\nIt include remote desktop, remote control, terminal, remote terminal(SSH, TELNET), file transfers(FTP, SFTP), player, network tools etc functions.","developer":"KangLin","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/KangLin.RabbitRemoteControl/0ae7b17330d1fd76d57115ea2500390e/icons/128x128/io.github.KangLin.RabbitRemoteControl.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/KangLin.RabbitRemoteControl/0ae7b17330d1fd76d57115ea2500390e/screenshots/image-1_zh_TW_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/KangLin.RabbitRemoteControl/0ae7b17330d1fd76d57115ea2500390e/screenshots/image-1_1248x701@1_zh_TW.png","w":1366,"h":768},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/KangLin.RabbitRemoteControl/0ae7b17330d1fd76d57115ea2500390e/screenshots/image-2_zh_TW_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/KangLin.RabbitRemoteControl/0ae7b17330d1fd76d57115ea2500390e/screenshots/image-2_1248x701@1_zh_TW.png","w":1366,"h":768},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/KangLin.RabbitRemoteControl/0ae7b17330d1fd76d57115ea2500390e/screenshots/image-3_zh_TW_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/KangLin.RabbitRemoteControl/0ae7b17330d1fd76d57115ea2500390e/screenshots/image-3_1248x701@1_zh_TW.png","w":1366,"h":768},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/KangLin.RabbitRemoteControl/0ae7b17330d1fd76d57115ea2500390e/screenshots/image-4_zh_TW_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/g